index 7fe0f4e..ce2f316 100644
--- a/src/sfm/README.md
+++ b/src/sfm/README.md
@@ -1505,3 +1505,7 @@ and incremental database updates. Models without shared images or rig frames
 can already align through verified shared structure (`Mapper::alignByStructure`).
 Models with no usable overlap or other alignment evidence cannot be joined
 automatically on visual evidence alone.
+
+### Explicit image pairs
+
+`sfm auto ... --pairs-file pairs.tsv` matches exactly the listed image pairs. Each line contains two exact image-directory-relative names, including extensions, separated by one tab; each name must exist uniquely and a line cannot pair an image with itself. Blank, malformed and unknown-image lines fail. Reverse or repeated pairs collapse to one canonical pair. The file must contain at least one pair. GPS and rig-mate pair expansion do not add pairs in this mode. Matching and matching-journal caches are not reused, so editing the list cannot silently reuse an old graph. Feature extraction reuse remains separate and must be validated against the images, masks and extraction settings.
